e Agents tab paints the hint input bar [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]immediately and renders numbered hints in bounded, cached, off-pump[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]work, so hint latency stops scaling with transcript size, family [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]member count, or auto-refresh cadence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agents_view_hints_perf.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Instrument and baseline the view-hints keypath[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]measure[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]measure: add end-to-end trace spans for the `v` keypath, add a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]view-hints scenario to the TUI trace bench, capture a committed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]baseline, and document the new spans in the perf runbook. No behavior [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]change.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bound hint-mode content and remove per-fragment disk work[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bound[dim] · [dim][/dim]after measure[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bound: apply the normal render path's byte/line caps to hint-mode body [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]content (including family member fragments), hoist per-chunk workspace [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution out of the family hint loop, and memoize hint path [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Paint the hint bar before rendering the annotated document[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]offpump[dim] · [dim][/dim]after measure[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]offpump: restructure the view-files action so the hint input bar mounts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]first and the annotated render runs as a pump-free task, with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]readiness guard so an early submission still resolves against complete [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hint mappings.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Cache the annotated hint document[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bound[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cache: memoize the hint render result and wrap the annotated document in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a width-keyed cached renderable so repeat presses, refresh repaints, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]post-enrichment repaints reuse rendered segments.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop redundant hint re-renders on refresh and enrichment[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]dedupe[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cache, offpump[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]dedupe: skip the full hint document rebuild on Agents-tab refreshes and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]header-enrichment messages whose inputs did not change, and stop the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one-second summary TTL from forcing repeated enrichment while hint mode [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]is active.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Verify the speedup and guard it[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after dedupe[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: re-run the view-hints bench against the committed baseline, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record the after numbers, add a regression floor, and sync the help [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]popup and perf runbook with any user-visible behavior change.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-a5","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-a5.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-19ce27904112a1a7682f8a9fed1f0dc9","started_at":"2026-07-27T18:23:53.609886+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785232875,"sha":"a49e63e3581075d5681a3a593234ddb6462f78d1","subject":"perf(ace): guard Agents-tab view-hints latency (sase-a5.6)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"c3d7a26012673b0aaeb397f877e645ff7055b9d1fca810eceaa52964c53a9070","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.6/chat.md","size_bytes":15061},"commits":{"digest":"0ea0793d17ec9fb93fbf6d849b0f1b38146fb85e85d7e8381e5cb0168b7ead4b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.6/commits.json","size_bytes":236},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.6/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"c7279a923988d0d34f7eaa5e97bbf83c9984869aff58a668f8660d7f394c8cf1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.6/meta.json","size_bytes":526},"prompt":{"digest":"7a6839ed689ecd58593f3d9b78df0224cd1b5ba1bb3f1380377004716423b991","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.6/prompt.md","size_bytes":153},"state":{"digest":"567e3c950f60874cd99adad7e88b402e75e4724029e3387d9b65cecbead002b1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.6/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.6","local_name":"sase-a5.6","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-a5","agent_clan_generation":"20260727142339","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-a5.6","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-26a6a02e8d035771cf39c6b597b69ecf","started_at":"2026-07-28T09:37:17.482885+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785186454,"sha":"41ba006bd4c6f41a041abae4508d2ed90c5c8f24